  "description": "Provider arranges unchanged zero, one and many metadata candidates for hint-zero, hint-one and hint-many respectively, with material available for the one. A fourth target has a missing personal mapping plus a valid org grant: hint unavailable, create retains mapped_credential_missing, not a hint enum. New connection, no supplied login, no explicit choice only. Each named target has an exclusive tag equal to its id; filtered list reads select that row for the field-omission checks.",
